commander\u2014whether it's a fun, unique character or the most powerful leader possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502130/extras/77a61b72e6ed1352a7858bc2a8751e2d.avif?t=1740122171\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your forces through <strong>four different campaigns</strong> in a war for global supremacy. Capture cities, unlock new characters, and battle for a world under your faction\u2019s banner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502130/extras/39ac50f438be441aea5e6ae6abd2a1c5.avif?t=1740122171\" width=78 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everyone Fights</strong> gives a new city-building spin to the familiar turn-based war gaming genre. Try it out!</p>",
